==Russian==

===Etymology===
Related to Old Church Slavonic {{m|orv|лихъ||superfluous, excessive, bad}} from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*lixъ||remaining, unnecessary, superfluous, bad}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|изли́шний}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-излишний.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|изли́шний}}

# [[unnecessary]], [[excessive]] (often due to inappropriateness)
#: {{syn|ru|избы́точный<q:partial>|нену́жный<q:partial>|чрезме́рный}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''изли́шняя''' [[ве́жливость]]|excessive politeness}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''изли́шние''' [[хло́поты]]|unnecessary trouble/hassle}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''изли́шняя''' [[осторо́жность]]|excessive caution}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''изли́шний''' [[коммента́рий]]|unnecessary comment}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''изли́шние''' [[покупка|поку́пки]]|unnecessary purchases}}

====Declension====
{{ru-decl-adj|изли́шний|a*}}
